  "given_answer": "\\(\\left ( { 5，-3 } \\right )\\)",
  "answer": "\\(\\left ( { 5，-3 } \\right )\\)",
  "given_solution": "",
  "given_solution_figures": [],
  "solution": "解：∵点P到x轴的距离是3，到y轴的距离是5，\n∴\\(\\left | { y } \\right |=3，\\left | { x } \\right |=5\\)．\n∵第四象限内点的横坐标大于零，纵坐标小于零，\n∴点P的坐标是\\(\\left ( { 5，-3 } \\right )\\)，\n故答案为：\\(\\left ( { 5，-3 } \\right )\\)．",
